<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>ossai75.ng</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{height:100%;background:#4A148C}
body{font-family:sans-serif;overflow:hidden}
/* SPLASH X3 BIG */
#splash{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:999;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4A148C,#8E24AA);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:1s}
#splash.hide{transform:translateY(-100%)}
.s-logo{width:98vw;height:98vw;max-width:800px;max-height:800px;background:white;border-radius:80px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.s-logo img{width:90%;height:90%;object-fit:contain}
.s-text{font-size:82px;font-weight:900;color:white;margin-top:15px}
.s-sub{font-size:38px;font-weight:900;color:white}

/* MAIN - LOGO X2-3 BIGGER NOW + TEXTS BIGGER */
#main{position:fixed;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4A148C,#8E24AA);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:100px 0}
.center-logo{width:96vw;height:96vw;max-width:760px;max-height:760px;background:white;border-radius:90px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 30px 90px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)}
.center-logo img{width:88%;height:88%;object-fit:contain}
h1{font-size:78px;font-weight:900;color:white;margin:20px 0 5px;letter-spacing:1px}
.sub{font-size:38px;font-weight:900;color:white;margin-bottom:30px}
.btn{width:92vw;max-width:500px;padding:32px;border-radius:70px;border:none;font-size:36px;font-weight:900;margin:12px}
.white{background:white;color:#6A1B9A}
.out{border:5px solid white;color:white;background:transparent}

/* ADS SPACY + SLOW */
.marq{position:fixed;left:0;width:100%;overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;z-index:50}
.top{top:0;padding:36px 0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.22)}
.bot{bottom:0;padding:36px 0;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.55)}
.marq b{font-size:52px;font-weight:900;color:white;display:inline-block;animation:move 55s linear infinite}
@keyframes move{from{transform:translateX(100vw)}to{transform:translateX(-100%)}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="splash">
<div class="s-logo"><img src="icon.png"></div>
<div class="s-text">ossai75.ng</div>
<div class="s-sub">Pregnant Mothers Care App</div>
</div>
<div id="main">
<div class="marq top"><b>🔥 OSSAI75.NG ★ PREGNANT MOTHERS CARE ★ MAMACOIN 2000PTS = ₦7000 ★ BABYCOIN LOCKED ★ CHEERSCOIN BONUS AFTER 3 YEARS ★ 🔥</b></div>
<div class="center-logo"><img src="icon.png"></div>
<h1>ossai75.ng</h1>
<div class="sub">Pregnant Mothers Care App</div>
<button class="btn white">Create Account</button>
<button class="btn out">Login</button>
<div class="marq bot"><b>💜 WATCH ADS 6 ADS = 1 POINT ★ VERIFIED 3 ADS = 1 POINT ★ MAX 10 MAMACOINS ★ 4 QUOTES = 10 ADS 💜</b></div>
</div>
<script>setTimeout(()=>document.getElementById('splash').classList.add('hide'),3000)</script>
</body>
</html>
